  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5102.20 Cunningham Pond",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.20 Cunningham Pond. No person shall operate a motorboat powered by gasoline, naphtha, or any other petroleum products on Cunningham Pond, located in the town of Peterborough.\n\nSource. #9544, eff 9-15-09; ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.181) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100)",
